  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Momentum:</strong> Your aggressive and relentless tactics expand your Momentum.</p><ul><li><p>Gain a Momentum when you succeed on an attack roll, deal Severe damage, or defeat an adversary.</p></li><li><p>Lose a Momentum if there isn’t an adversary within Very Close range at the end of your spotlight, or when you roll a failure with Fear. At the end of the scene reduce your Momentum to 0.</p></li></ul><p>You gain a bonus to your damage thresholds and your damage rolls equal to your Momentum. Your maximum Momentum is equal to your Strength.</p>",
